Binaries
--------

The fonts in sys/fonts/, sys/demo/tvbgar.qfasl and sys/sys/ucinit.qfasl are
MIT's, from System 100, and have no source form in this tree (docs/fonts.md in
the repository).
A release's microcode (sys/ubin/) and its band are built from these sources.
